{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>THE 8IGHT is a 3D first-person psychological horror/story game.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You will step into the shoes of Max, a protagonist suffering from schizophrenia, and uncover hidden truths while enduring the torment of hallucinations and delusions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i><strong>Ultimately, you will decide his fate.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The origin of the recurring nightmares</strong>, <strong>the cause of his schizophrenia</strong>, and the secrets buried within it all\u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Was it really just schizophrenia causing these psychological symptoms (hallucinations and delusions)?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Determined to break free from his nightmarish fate, Max starts to move within his home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>And first, he must find the medication</strong> that can alleviate his symptoms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Perhaps that medication might hold the key to solving everything... but who knows?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>[Schizophrenia]</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1316720/extras/sc_en.png?t=1741193966\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game is primarily experienced from the perspective of Max, the protagonist suffering from schizophrenia.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As such, various elements are designed to enhance immersion, such as objects moving abnormally or locations suddenly changing\u2014representing the mental state of a protagonist living with schizophrenia.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>[Story]</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1316720/extras/story_en.png?t=1741193966\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As the game progresses, players gradually uncover the hidden story of Max.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Delve into the secrets of Max as he faces a nightmare-like fate amidst a psychologically dark atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>[Intuitive Puzzles]</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1316720/extras/puzzle_en.png?t=1741193966\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">To enhance the gameplay experience and help players better understand the story, intuitive puzzle elements are scattered throughout the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Solve puzzles using the provided hints to advance through the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>[Multiple Endings]</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1316720/extras/multiending_en.png?t=1741193966\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game's ending varies depending on the choices players make during the gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But don\u2019t worry\u2014a save point is always nearby when significant choices arise.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience the multiple endings and see what fate awaits Max.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"The Beginning of the Nightmare","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1316720/082a28782712dffe34653fcb9f713488d8c5bf4a.jpg"},{"name":"Repeat Playback","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1316720/c005300a8bdfea895b245187ad61bfe16c6f875c.jpg"},{"name":"Noble Sacrifice","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1316720/cc955297f247ab7b0b0f96ad4c5c129287f18906.jpg"},{"name":"Recurring Nightmare","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1316720/3d6f67027e9212c0727b34af2579d82630214c92.jpg"},{"name":"End of the Nightmare","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1316720/94bb0c85d7f045c8f3c7e2e79ff4e6f47eb47e63.jpg"},{"name":"What was that again?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1316720/0f9c16866a86c7aba373f77494728fff04378911.jpg"},{"name":"Watch your step","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1316720/c6c5e7f990b2ae5ebf0644bc85a00d386ba5ce6f.jpg"},{"name":"Dizziness","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1316720/39b6e50c8cdb6b63496ce15c9aea61ad904fc729.jpg"},{"name":"I won\u2019t let go.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1316720/1d8ccd137a098d952e6096db5113aeeafb011ef3.jpg"},{"name":"Fate","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1316720/c9fd3d7074de71655a42f91556517f13773f110c.jpg"}],"total":13},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1316720?t=1741193966","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1316720/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1741193966","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1316720/d24eb486ca386c5ea1f2b862b56880c0f7c05539/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1741193966","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1316720/d24eb486ca386c5ea1f2b862b56880c0f7c05539/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1741193966","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>THE 8IGHT is a 3D first-person psychological horror/story game.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You will step into the shoes of Max, a protagonist suffering from schizophrenia, and uncover hidden truths while enduring the torment of hallucinations and delusions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i><strong>Ultimately, you will decide his fate.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The origin of the recurring nightmares</strong>, <strong>the cause of his schizophrenia</strong>, and the secrets buried within it all\u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Was it really just schizophrenia causing these psychological symptoms (hallucinations and delusions)?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Determined to break free from his nightmarish fate, Max starts to move within his home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>And first, he must find the medication</strong> that can alleviate his symptoms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Perhaps that medication might hold the key to solving everything... but who knows?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>[Schizophrenia]</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1316720/extras/sc_en.png?t=1741193966\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game is primarily experienced from the perspective of Max, the protagonist suffering from schizophrenia.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As such, various elements are designed to enhance immersion, such as objects moving abnormally or locations suddenly changing\u2014representing the mental state of a protagonist living with schizophrenia.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>[Story]</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1316720/extras/story_en.png?t=1741193966\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As the game progresses, players gradually uncover the hidden story of Max.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Delve into the secrets of Max as he faces a nightmare-like fate amidst a psychologically dark atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>[Intuitive Puzzles]</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1316720/extras/puzzle_en.png?t=1741193966\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">To enhance the gameplay experience and help players better understand the story, intuitive puzzle elements are scattered throughout the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Solve puzzles using the provided hints to advance through the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>[Multiple Endings]</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1316720/extras/multiending_en.png?t=1741193966\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game's ending varies depending on the choices players make during the gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But don\u2019t worry\u2014a save point is always nearby when significant choices arise.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience the multiple endings and see what fate awaits Max.</p>","developers":["KJAE GAMES"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1316720/header.jpg?t=1741193966","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2025 KJAE GAMES, all rights reserved.<br />\r\nTHE 8IGHT is a registered trademark, trademark or service mark of KJAE GAMES","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257099315,"mp4":{"480":"htt